{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And he shall make atonement for himself, etc.</b> The second confession — over himself and over his brothers the priests, for they are all called his house, as it says, ״בֵּית אַהֲרֹן בָּרֲכוּ אֶת ה׳״ etc. (Psalms 135). From here that the priests obtain atonement through it, and all their atonement is only for defilement of the Temple and its holy things, as it says (verse 16), ״וְכִפֶּר עַל הַקֹּדֶשׁ מִטֻּמְאֹת״ etc. (Sifra; Shevuot 7)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:06:45.090012069Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}